},"created_at":"2026-03-10T11:25:05Z","updated_at":"2026-03-10T11:25:05Z","body":"Tried a quickly adding a bool to the TabBar signal tab_changed called is_pointer_event. Not sure if this what we want to do, but it could solve the problem\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7d544710-647f-461e-8951-dd48f7336b3a\n\nAnd something like this for the code:\n```\nfunc _on_tab_container_tab_changed(tab: int, is_pointer_event: bool) -> void:\n\tprints(\"tab:\", tab, \"pointer event:\", is_pointer_event)\n\t\n\tif is_pointer_event:\n\t\tif tab_container.current_tab == 0:\n\t\t\t\tline_edit.grab_focus()\n\t\telif tab_container.current_tab == 1:\n\t\t\t\tline_edit_2.grab_focus()\n```\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4030678778/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4033484309","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117267#issuecomment-4033484309","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117267","id":4033484309,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7wahYV","user":{"login":"D-SehKim","id":123012677,"node_id":"U_kgDOB1UGRQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123012677?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/D-SehKim","html_url":"https://github.com/D-SehKim","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/D-SehKim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/D-SehKim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/D-SehKim/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/D-SehKim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/D-SehKim/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/D-SehKim/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/D-SehK